WEBVTT

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.960
Verone Academy

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:22.640
It sounds like the practice 
for the relay has started.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.430
I'm so glad Shiho's back 
to her old self again.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:36.740
I've thought about it for a 
long, long tome now, but...

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.450
I'm going to quit lacrosse.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.120
Over here! Over here!

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:50.630
I promise I'll catch it!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.670
Believe in your friends!

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.670
Shiho!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:57.860
Nagisa!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.660
Nice pass, Shiho!

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.790
Shoot, Nagisa!

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:17.590
But Jyaku-King has come back to life again.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.710
If the power of darkness gets any stronger...

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.510
What's wrong, Nagisa? You're next.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:26.350
Okay! I'll do my best.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:28.530
Just because this is 
practice, don't slack off.

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:29.740
Okay!

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.890
Just as I expected, Nagisa sure is fast.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.490
This year, pink is the strongest.

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:39.910
You're so lucky...

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:44.170
Nagisa's in top form, 
and Yumiko's the anchor!

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.850
Boy! I sure wish I was on the same team!

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.770
There's no way I can win 
running against Nagisa.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:53.890
Why does the class to be divided 
into two teams... Pink and white?

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.190
For the relay, rather 
than having three teams,

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:58.190
it's more interesting if we 
have six teams, isn't it?

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:06.530
Just what I'd expect from you, Misumi-san.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:10.010
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:12.810
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:15.650
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:19.920
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.890
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:25.760
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.660
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.560
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:38.970
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.070
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:48.850
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:54.590
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.460
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:57.460 --> 00:03:03.730
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:04.630
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:07.330
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.130
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:13.040
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.610
<i>Together we are</i>

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.680
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.630
Those people from the Field of Rainbows...

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:45.540
I never expected them to 
put up so much resistance.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.730
What is that power anyway?

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:52.930
There's something besides that power...

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.950
It's about time we settled this...

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:01.230
This time I'll settle it for sure...

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.520
Huh?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.230
This time I'll settle it for sure...

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:08.720
What?

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.140
I said...

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:12.720
Huh?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.840
I said...

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.500
I'll settle it!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.200
I'll settle it! I'll settle it!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:31.460
No matter what happens, don't let 
it get to you down, little girls.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:44.460
"NAGISA BREAKS AWAY! 
THE BLAZING 'GACHINKO' RELAY!"

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:50.570
Verone Academy Girls' Middle 
Division Sports Festival

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.690
The second-year students 
participating in the hoop dance,

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:56.110
please gather at the entrance gate.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.710
She's broadcasting, but Honoka will 
be doing this dance, too, won't she?

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.490
Of course.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:11.060
The sports festival looks like fun mipo.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:14.970
Just being here with you 
like this is fun mepo.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.790
Mepple, you...

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.490
Mipple!

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:21.340
Mepple!

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:26.910
I'm having fun, too popo. Let's play popo!

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:30.800
Pollun... You're hopeless mipo.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:37.030
It would have been perfect 
if it wasn't for him mepo!

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:47.720
Fuji-P?

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:56.430
Nagisa!

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.880
Hang in there, Misumi!

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:17.280
Nagisa's an all-around athlete, but she 
can be spacey sometimes, can't she?

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:19.670
That's probably why she's so popular.

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:23.620
Anyway, with Nagisa and Yumiko, this 
year's relay should be a breeze.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:24.750
I suppose.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:31.110
As the Verone Academy's superstar,

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.880
I'll stake my pride before I let them win.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.960
I'm going to be in the 
sports festival, too popo.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.230
I'm going to join them popo.

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:40.020
You can't mipo!

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:43.350
I'm going to join them popo!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:44.980
Pollun! You can't mipo!

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.190
It'll be terrible if someone saw you mipo!

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.000
What a troublemaker mepo.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.790
Come back mipo!

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.280
I'm going to join them popo!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:55.750
Come back!

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:56.970
Popo... popo...

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.570
I'm going to play, too, Popo.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:06.680
That Nagisa! Why can't she get it straight?

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:11.710
No! It's more important to get a 
laugh no matter what you're doing.

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:14.640
Can't you find a better way to praise her?

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:21.220
Popo... popo... popo...

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:23.010
Popo... popo...

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:29.960
Achichi no chi... Achichi no chi...

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:37.130
I'm hungry.

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:38.480
Already?

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.900
You did really well.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.310
Yuka!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:46.270
But if you get too enthusiastic, 
you won't last until the relay.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:52.010
So are you saying that 
your team will win, Yuka?

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:56.330
Don't worry... We won't lose that easily.

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:02.130
Really? We'll just have 
to see what you can do.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:05.630
Odajima-san...

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:09.260
It's just as I thought.... 
She doesn't like me.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:14.120
That's not true... She just 
wants her rival to do her best.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.800
Her rival? Me?

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:20.500
You're overestimating me.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.060
Honoka? Don't you have to get 
back to the broadcasting booth?

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.020
That's right. I forgot.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.120
Student body members are busy, aren't they?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.840
Just during the morning segment.

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:42.930
Achichi no chi. Achichi no chi!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:49.250
Achichi no chi. Achi... Popo!

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:07.200
The basketball throwing 
competition has started.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:10.470
First-year students... Do your best.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.050
Popo! Popo!

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.740
Verone Academy Girls' Middle 
Division Sports Festival

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:27.760
You call did very well in the morning half...

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:31.210
Let's continue at this pace, and 
go to the relay race with spirit.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:37.040
Mipple is gone!

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.760
I'm starved.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.000
Fried chicken!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.810
Mipple is gone...

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.320
What am I going to do?

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.570
Pollun is gone, too. This is bad.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.640
So the main event is the 
relay in the afternoon.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:56.910
Fuji-P?

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.490
What is it, Hasekura?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.160
The person you were talking 
about in the relay race

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.940
is the one who was dancing next 
to Yukishiro-san, isn't it?

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.910
You mean Misumi-san? That's right.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:09.900
So she's the one...

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.440
Don't tell me, you're...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.850
No! It's not what you think.

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:17.370
Then what is it?

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:21.330
I was just looking forward to it, that's all.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:25.710
I'm worried about Mipple and Mepple, but 
I'm especially worried about Pollun.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:29.310
So am I. We have to find them soon.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.700
I haven't eaten my lunch yet.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.080
Nagisa!

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:36.910
Mepple?

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:37.520
Mipple?

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:38.680
Honoka!

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.280
Mepo! Mepo! Mepo! Mepo!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:41.960
What's wrong?

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.100
Mipo! Mipo!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.120
Where's Pollun?

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:47.430
We have to hurry, and find Pollun 
before there's trouble mepo!

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:51.110
We tried to stop him, but Pollun 
still left the classroom mipo!

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:52.290
What are we going to do mipo?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:56.200
I feel a really sinister 
presence close by mipo!

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:58.680
A sinister presence...

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.110
Close by?

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:04.480
Achichi no chi... Achichi no chi!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.780
Achichi no chi!

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:27.170
Where did Nagisa and Yukishiro-san go?

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.470
Have you found them?

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:30.240
No... They're not here. I can't find them.

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:32.410
I wonder what happened.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.200
The relay is going to start soon.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:39.180
That Pollun sure is a lot of trouble.

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.890
I agree mepo!

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.110
We have to hurry, and find him 
before something happens mipo.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:46.470
Where did he go?

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:49.090
We have to get back soon 
before the relay starts.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.560
You're right.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:53.040
Pollun... What are we going to do?

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.030
Was that the piano?

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.060
Who could that be?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.070
Wait a minute mipo!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.240
I have a bad feeling about this mepo!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.540
But it might be Pollun.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.570
Nagisa!

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.300
You're...?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:29.820
Where's the power of the Prism Stones?

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.650
Please... tell me.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:34.960
Tell you...? But...

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.940
Tell me!

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:51.730
Nagisa!

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:52.390
I'm okay.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.840
Where did the power of the stones go?

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.820
Honoka... Ready?

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:06.690
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:41.960
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:44.660
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:48.460
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:51.870
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:55.310
Go back to where you came from!

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.510
Black?

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:02.210
I'm okay. Let's go!

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:06.430
I guess I'll have to force 
you to tell me then.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.820
Come, Zakenna!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.130
Zakenna!

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:19.440
Zakenna!

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:21.600
What is that anyway?

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.910
Zakenna!

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:26.350
There's no use running away.

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:28.330
Let's close the fire prevention shutter.

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:28.810
Okay!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.750
Zakenna!

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.190
It was a success!

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:37.850
Maybe not.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.750
That can't be!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:46.860
White!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:47.720
Thank you!

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:55.370
Just give it up.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.250
You're so persistent!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.240
What do you mean Nagisa's not here?

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:10.210
I looked for her, but I couldn't find her.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:11.220
What is she doing?

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:13.190
The relay is going to start!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.950
Zakenna!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.540
I've had enough of this!

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.180
Black!

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:30.220
I should have eaten my lunch.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.620
Pull yourself together, Black!

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:35.000
Zakenna!

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.050
White!

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:46.240
Misumi-san isn't here, is she?

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:49.240
You're right. I don't see her anywhere.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.690
The race is about to start...

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:53.210
Nagisa's not here yet.

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:54.690
It's strange isn't it?

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:59.530
Don't worry. Nagisa isn't so irresponsible 
that she'd skip out on a race.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:01.500
You're right.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.110
I'm sure she'll show up.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.850
If worse comes to worse, I'll run two legs.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:07.030
So don't worry!

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.970
But the anchor has to run 
one and a half times around.

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:12.070
What happened, Misumi-san?

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.720
If you don't come, I 
don't have any incentive.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:18.080
Haven't you reached your limit yet?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:21.920
Now tell me... Where did 
the Power of Creation go?

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.900
Do you think we'll tell?

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.370
We won't lose! We refuse to lose to 
the likes of you and your cohorts!

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:30.660
Really? Then it can't be helped!

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:33.780
Zakenna!

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.010
It's hot!

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.230
Achichi...!

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.310
Popo?

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.150
Popo... popo... popo...

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.120
Danger popo...

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:49.280
Black... White...

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:57.910
Pretty Cula's in danger popo!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:09.140
Accept the power of light popo!

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:32.260
The Pretty Cure Rainbow Bracelet?

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:33.890
All right!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:35.290
What?

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.380
Zakenna!

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.370
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:49.600
And fight your way toward the future!

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:53.530
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:07.960
Za...

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:10.500
Zakenna!

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:15.500
Zakenna!

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:17.680
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.330
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:26.000
Pollun!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.770
But where did it come from?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.480
The relay!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.580
Do you best, Rina!

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:43.170
Do your best, Shiho!

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:46.020
Yumiko...?

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.030
It can't be helped.

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:48.550
Get everybody to move up one...

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:51.610
You're next, Nagisa... Hurry, and get here.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.060
Excuse me! Let me through.

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.050
Nagisa!

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.670
Let me through!

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:03.310
Excuse me!

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.930
Let me through!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:08.720
Yumiko!

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:11.810
This is terrible!

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.710
What is Nagisa doing anyway?

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:18.330
Yumiko!

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:23.230
No matter how fast she is, doing 
double duty is impossible.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.840
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:26.720
Nagisa!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.310
You made it in time to be the anchor!

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.280
I'm sorry!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.260
Nagisa! Your ribbon!

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.770
Thank you!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:33.550
Do your best!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.250
Nagisa!

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:43.980
This is going to be interesting.

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:49.640
You're really late!

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.470
I'm sorry!

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:55.030
Nagisa!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.720
Do your best, Nagisa!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:07.580
Those two are awesome.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:08.660
Yuka's really fast.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:12.590
This is awesome.

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:13.570
Go! Go!

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:14.920
Those two are awesome.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.330
Just what I'd expect from you, Misumi-san.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.030
I won't lose!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:25.490
Go, Nagisa! Go!

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:28.700
Go! Go! Go, Nagisa!

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:32.430
Wow! That's great!

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:33.400
Nagisa!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.320
Half a lap top go!

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:42.620
They're evenly matched.

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:44.970
You're doing great!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:45.810
Just a little more.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:50.300
You've captured my heart!

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:04.540
Here is the result of the relay race...

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.350
First place... Pink!

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:09.970
You did it!

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:11.860
I did it!

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:15.100
How could you! It can't be!

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:16.230
What is that?

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.920
I'm starved.

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:27.180
Let's race again someday, Misumi-san.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:29.940
She doesn't like me after all.

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:31.390
When I'm around her,

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.290
she always manages to break down 
my guard as the school superstar.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:35.920
I'd better be careful.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.060
Popo...

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.950
Is this where you were mipo?

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:41.230
You're always causing trouble mepo!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.900
Mepple's mad at me popo.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.110
It's okay... Don't worry mipo.

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.100
Mepo!

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:58.130
Aren't you going to eat, Honoka?

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.450
I'll eat it for you.

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:03.540
It's so delicious.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.580
You don't have to rush like that.

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.360
Your bento lunch is the best, Honoka.

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:17.300
It's delicious!

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:20.220
Thank you for the meal!

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.180
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:29.880
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.760
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:06.260
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.110
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.350
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.520
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:32.120
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:35.330
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:43.030
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:54.620
What am I going to do?

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.610
I've been invited to pick chestnuts 
by a boy in the Boys' Division.

00:23:56.610 --> 00:23:57.430
Please, Honoka...

00:23:57.430 --> 00:23:58.380
Turn it down for me.

00:23:58.380 --> 00:23:59.760
Do it yourself.

00:23:59.760 --> 00:24:02.410
Happy birthday! Here's my present.

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:04.150
Thank you... I'm really happy.

00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:06.020
But please... Honoka!

00:24:06.020 --> 00:24:08.600
No! But it might be fun.

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:10.470
That chestnut is too big.

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:11.780
Don't tell me, it's...?

00:24:12.460 --> 00:24:15.400
"IS THIS A DATE? 
TUMULTUOUS HAPPY BIRTHDAY"

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:17.100
I could make ten tons of "kuri-kinton" 
(mashed sweet potatoes with chestnuts)

00:24:17.100 --> 00:24:18.170
with a chestnut that big...

00:24:18.170 --> 00:24:20.190
That's "muri-kinton" (impossible)...?
